{"seq":2,"slug":"cell-engineering","title":"高二生物 — 细胞工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/biology/biotechnology/cell-engineering","wordCount":2372,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"高二生物-细胞工程\">高二生物 — 细胞工程</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>细胞工程是在细胞水平上对生物进行改造的技术体系。与基因工程在分子水平上操作 DNA 不同，细胞工程直接操作整个细胞——培养、融合、重编程。植物组织培养和动物细胞融合是两大核心技术，它们在农业育种、医药研发和基础研究中发挥着不可替代的作用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>操作对象</th>\n<th>核心原理</th>\n<th>主要应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>植物组织培养</td>\n<td>植物细胞/组织</td>\n<td>细胞全能性</td>\n<td>快速繁殖、脱毒苗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>植物体细胞杂交</td>\n<td>两种植物细胞</td>\n<td>细胞融合</td>\n<td>远缘杂交育种</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动物细胞培养</td>\n<td>动物细胞</td>\n<td>体外增殖</td>\n<td>生物制品生产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动物细胞融合</td>\n<td>两种动物细胞</td>\n<td>细胞融合</td>\n<td>单克隆抗体制备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核移植</td>\n<td>细胞核</td>\n<td>核的全能性</td>\n<td>克隆动物</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-植物细胞的全能性\">一、植物细胞的全能性</h3><p>细胞全能性是指已分化的细胞仍然具有发育成完整个体的潜能。这是因为每个体细胞都含有该物种的全套遗传信息（基因组完整）。</p>\n<p>全能性高低排列：受精卵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span> 生殖细胞 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span> 干细胞 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span> 体细胞</p>\n<p>在自然条件下，分化的体细胞不表现全能性（基因表达被调控限制）。但通过人工手段（离体培养、特定激素处理），可以激活细胞的全能性。植物细胞的全能性比动物细胞更容易表达——这是植物组织培养成功的基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-植物组织培养\">二、植物组织培养</h3><p>植物组织培养是将植物的离体器官、组织或细胞在无菌条件下培养成完整植株的技术。</p>\n<p><strong>基本流程：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>外植体</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>脱分化</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>愈伤组织</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>再分化</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>胚状体/丛芽</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>培养</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>完整植株</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{外植体} \\xrightarrow{\\text{脱分化}} \\text{愈伤组织} \\xrightarrow{\\text{再分化}} \\text{胚状体/丛芽} \\xrightarrow{\\text{培养}} \\text{完整植株}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">外植体</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">脱分化</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">愈伤组织</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">再分化</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">胚状体</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">丛芽</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">培养</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">完整植株</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>过程</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>取材</td>\n<td>选取植物的茎尖、叶片、花药等</td>\n<td>选健康、幼嫩的部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灭菌</td>\n<td>外植体用酒精和次氯酸钠消毒</td>\n<td>严格无菌操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脱分化</td>\n<td>细胞失去原有特化功能，回到未分化状态</td>\n<td>生长素/细胞分裂素比值较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>愈伤组织</td>\n<td>细胞不断分裂形成无定形的细胞团</td>\n<td>暗培养、高湿度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>再分化</td>\n<td>愈伤组织细胞重新分化出根、芽等器官</td>\n<td>调整激素比例（降低生长素/细胞分裂素比值）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移栽</td>\n<td>炼苗后移入土壤</td>\n<td>逐步适应自然环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>植物激素的调控作用：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生长素/细胞分裂素比值</th>\n<th>分化方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>促进根的分化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>促进芽的分化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适中</td>\n<td>促进愈伤组织生长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>应用：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>快速繁殖</strong>（微繁殖）：一个茎尖在短时间内繁殖出数千株遗传一致的后代</li>\n<li><strong>脱毒苗生产</strong>：茎尖分生区不含病毒，通过茎尖培养获得无病毒植株</li>\n<li><strong>人工种子</strong>：将胚状体包裹在含营养物质的凝胶中</li>\n<li><strong>花药培养</strong>：获得单倍体植株（配合秋水仙素处理可获得纯合体）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"三-植物体细胞杂交\">三、植物体细胞杂交</h3><p>植物体细胞杂交技术可以将两种不同植物的细胞融合为一个杂种细胞，再培育成杂种植株，突破了有性杂交的远缘不亲和障碍。</p>\n<p><strong>基本步骤：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>去壁</strong>：用纤维素酶和果胶酶处理两种植物细胞，获得原生质体</li>\n<li><strong>诱导融合</strong>：化学法（聚乙二醇 PEG）或物理法（电融合）使两种原生质体融合</li>\n<li><strong>筛选杂种细胞</strong>：从融合产物中选出含有两个亲本遗传物质的杂种细胞</li>\n<li><strong>组织培养</strong>：杂种细胞经脱分化、再分化形成杂种植株</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>植物 A 细胞</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>去壁</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>原生质体 A</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>原生质体 B</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">←</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>去壁</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>植物 B 细胞</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{植物 A 细胞} \\xrightarrow{\\text{去壁}} \\text{原生质体 A} + \\text{原生质体 B} \\xleftarrow{\\text{去壁}} \\text{植物 B 细胞}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">植物</span><span class=\"mord\"> A </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">细胞</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">去壁</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原生质体</span><span class=\"mord\"> A</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原生质体</span><span class=\"mord\"> B</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">去壁</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M400000 241H110l3-3c68.7-52.7 113.7-120\n 135-202 4-14.7 6-23 6-25 0-7.3-7-11-21-11-8 0-13.2.8-15.5 2.5-2.3 1.7-4.2 5.8\n-5.5 12.5-1.3 4.7-2.7 10.3-4 17-12 48.7-34.8 92-68.5 130S65.3 228.3 18 247\nc-10 4-16 7.7-18 11 0 8.7 6 14.3 18 17 47.3 18.7 87.8 47 121.5 85S196 441.3 208\n 490c.7 2 1.3 5 2 9s1.2 6.7 1.5 8c.3 1.3 1 3.3 2 6s2.2 4.5 3.5 5.5c1.3 1 3.3\n 1.8 6 2.5s6 1 10 1c14 0 21-3.7 21-11 0-2-2-10.3-6-25-20-79.3-65-146.7-135-202\n l-3-3h399890zM100 241v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">植物</span><span class=\"mord\"> B </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">细胞</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>原生质体 A</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>原生质体 B</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>融合</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>杂种细胞</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>组培</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>杂种植株</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{原生质体 A} + \\text{原生质体 B} \\xrightarrow{\\text{融合}} \\text{杂种细胞} \\xrightarrow{\\text{组培}} \\text{杂种植株}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原生质体</span><span class=\"mord\"> A</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原生质体</span><span class=\"mord\"> B</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">融合</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">杂种细胞</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">组培</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">杂种植株</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>经典案例：番茄和马铃薯的体细胞杂交——虽然成功获得了杂种植株（&quot;番茄-马铃薯&quot;），但该植株未能同时表现出番茄结果和马铃薯结薯的优良性状，说明远缘杂交后基因表达的调控仍是巨大挑战。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-动物细胞培养\">四、动物细胞培养</h3><p>动物细胞培养是其他动物细胞工程技术（如融合、克隆）的基础。</p>\n<p><strong>培养条件：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>培养基</td>\n<td>含氨基酸、葡萄糖、维生素、矿物盐，通常还需加入动物血清（含生长因子）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>36.5</mn><mo>±</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36.5 \\pm 0.5°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>（模拟体温）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气体</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span> 空气 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\%\\,\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 维持 pH 稳定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无菌</td>\n<td>严格防止微生物污染</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>细胞增殖特点：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>原代培养：从组织取出细胞首次培养，细胞贴壁生长</li>\n<li>传代培养：用胰蛋白酶消化使细胞脱壁分散，分瓶继续培养</li>\n<li>大多数动物细胞有限增殖（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 代后衰老死亡）</li>\n<li>少数细胞可能发生基因突变变为永生化细胞系（如 HeLa 细胞）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"五-动物细胞融合与单克隆抗体\">五、动物细胞融合与单克隆抗体</h3><p>动物细胞融合技术最重要的应用是制备<strong>单克隆抗体</strong>（monoclonal antibody）。</p>\n<p><strong>传统方法的局限：</strong> 向动物注射抗原后获得的血清含有多种抗体（因为多种 B 淋巴细胞被激活），纯度低、特异性差。</p>\n<p><strong>杂交瘤技术</strong>（由科勒和米尔斯坦于 1975 年发明，获 1984 年诺贝尔奖）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>用特定抗原免疫小鼠，获得能产生特异性抗体的 B 淋巴细胞</li>\n<li>将 B 淋巴细胞与骨髓瘤细胞融合，获得杂交瘤细胞</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>细胞类型</th>\n<th>能产生抗体</th>\n<th>能无限增殖</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>B 淋巴细胞</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>骨髓瘤细胞</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>杂交瘤细胞</strong></td>\n<td><strong>✓</strong></td>\n<td><strong>✓</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>筛选出产生特定抗体的杂交瘤细胞并克隆扩增</li>\n<li>大量培养杂交瘤细胞（体外培养或注射到小鼠腹腔内），收获单克隆抗体</li>\n</ol>\n<p>单克隆抗体的优势：特异性强、灵敏度高、可大量生产。</p>\n<p>应用：疾病诊断试剂（如早孕试纸、COVID 快速检测）、靶向药物、免疫治疗。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-核移植与克隆技术\">六、核移植与克隆技术</h3><p>核移植是将一个细胞的细胞核转移到去核的卵母细胞中，构建重组胚胎并发育为新个体的技术。</p>\n<p>1996 年克隆羊&quot;多莉&quot;的诞生证明了哺乳动物已分化的体细胞核仍具有全能性。多莉由苏格兰芬兰多赛特绵羊的乳腺细胞核 + 苏格兰黑面母羊的去核卵母细胞 + 另一只母羊代孕产生——三只母羊参与。</p>\n<p>核移植面临的挑战：成功率极低（多莉是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>277</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">277</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">277</span></span></span></span></span> 次尝试中唯一成功的），克隆动物常出现早衰和健康问题（可能与表观遗传重编程不完全有关）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>为什么植物组织培养要在无菌条件下进行？培养基中的营养物质对微生物是否也有吸引力？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在植物体细胞杂交中，为什么要先去除细胞壁？用什么方法去除？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>制备单克隆抗体时，为什么要将 B 淋巴细胞与骨髓瘤细胞融合，而不是直接培养 B 淋巴细胞？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>克隆羊多莉与提供乳腺细胞核的母羊遗传物质是否完全相同？考虑线粒体 DNA 的来源。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>植物组织培养中，如果要获得脱毒苗，应该取植物的什么部位作为外植体？为什么？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>HeLa 细胞是人类历史上最重要的细胞系。1951 年从宫颈癌患者海瑞塔·拉克斯体内取出的肿瘤细胞，成为第一个能在体外无限增殖的人类细胞系。七十多年来，HeLa 细胞参与了脊髓灰质炎疫苗开发、癌症研究、基因图谱绘制等无数医学突破。然而，这些细胞的采集未经拉克斯本人同意，她的家族长期不知情——这引发了关于生物样本知情同意和利益分享的深刻伦理反思。</p>\n<p>2012 年日本科学家山中伸弥因发现诱导多能干细胞（iPSC）技术而获诺贝尔奖。他证明只需四个转录因子就能将已分化的成体细胞&quot;重编程&quot;为类似胚胎干细胞的多能状态——这为再生医学和个性化治疗开辟了全新道路，同时避免了使用胚胎干细胞的伦理争议。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>植物组织培养基于细胞全能性，通过脱分化和再分化将离体细胞培育成完整植株</li>\n<li>植物体细胞杂交通过原生质体融合突破远缘杂交障碍</li>\n<li>动物细胞培养是动物细胞工程的基础，需要严格的温度、气体和无菌条件</li>\n<li>单克隆抗体利用杂交瘤技术，兼具 B 细胞的抗体产生能力和瘤细胞的无限增殖能力</li>\n<li>核移植技术证明了哺乳动物分化细胞核的全能性，但技术成功率仍很低</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高二生物 — 细胞工程","id":"高二生物-细胞工程"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、植物细胞的全能性","id":"一-植物细胞的全能性"},{"level":3,"text":"二、植物组织培养","id":"二-植物组织培养"},{"level":3,"text":"三、植物体细胞杂交","id":"三-植物体细胞杂交"},{"level":3,"text":"四、动物细胞培养","id":"四-动物细胞培养"},{"level":3,"text":"五、动物细胞融合与单克隆抗体","id":"五-动物细胞融合与单克隆抗体"},{"level":3,"text":"六、核移植与克隆技术","id":"六-核移植与克隆技术"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高二生物 — 基因工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/biology/biotechnology/genetic-engineering"},"next":{"title":"高二生物 — 发酵技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/biology/biotechnology/fermentation-tech"}}